        <div id="api-detail" class="bg-card border border-card rounded-xl p-6 md:p-10 mb-8 scroll-mt-[90px]">
            <div class="section-title flex items-center gap-3">
                2. API Lấy Chi Tiết Phim <span class="endpoint-badge">GET</span>
